{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Reunion", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Peter's Dream Job", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 18, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past Tense and Past Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or actions that were happening at a time in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular. <br>Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied</span>.<br> Irregular verbs change in different ways.<br> For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did </span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask \u2026 ?</span> <br><span class=\"italic\">Did </span>is the past form of<span class=\"italic\"> to do</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For Past Continuous, we add was/were + verb\u201cing\u201d to verbs.<br> Some verbs need a change to the last letter to add \u201cing\u201d.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" look \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"looked \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were looking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" sit \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sat \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were sitting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"read\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" read \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were reading\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"apply \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"applied \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were applying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"type  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"typing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were typing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"jump  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"jumped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were jumping\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I saw the ad when I was reading the newspaper. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I sat down when I was typing my r\u00e9sum\u00e9. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "chaise", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small couch ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sit on my comfy chaise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "secrecy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the condition of being secret or hidden ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Enough secrecy - tell us everything!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cover letter", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a letter attached to a resume explaining why you are good for a job ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was typing my resume and cover letter.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "It's meant to be", "type": "name"}, {"content": "destined or fated to exist ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The job is meant to be.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "big-name ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very successful company or person ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The company has big-name clients.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "client ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "customer; person who you provide a service to ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The big-name clients are the most important.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Fingers crossed ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "Good luck ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Fingers crossed for your new job!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Do some research about a job that you are really interested in.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 6 points about the job (hours, pay, tasks, etc.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Tell your partner about the job. Add many details.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner questions about their dream job.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I research about a dream job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share information about the job with my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask my partner about their dream job.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So, Peter, have a seat on my comfy chaise and tell me about your life!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, enough secrecy. Tell us everything!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, I applied for my dream job.<br>"}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob07re2img02.jpg", "time": "12000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Dream job?! What is it?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds exciting. My dream job is definitely being a chef. It's something I really want to do forever. What's yours, Peter?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I applied to a really big PR firm in Boston. I saw the ad when I was looking through the newspaper in the kitchen. It jumped out at me right away.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's meant to be!"}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "33500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I hope so. They are the largest PR firm in the area and they have many big-name clients. I got so nervous when I was typing my resume and cover letter.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I bet!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: When do you expect to hear back from them?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Maybe next week."}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "48000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Fingers crossed!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, good luck Peter!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks, you two."}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about rooms and objects in them. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk or report about actions, events or people. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can say what I was doing when something else happened.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  Do you have a dream job? What is it? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Why do you want that job?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "I applied for my dream job!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Peter talks about his <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">dream job</span> \u2026 what is it?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_at